: 1.12;\">Elige el punto de partida. El recorrido lo hacemos vuestro.<\/h2><\/div><p style=\"flex: 1 1 320px; margin: 0; color: #657083; font-size: 16px;\">Tres visitas privadas y un free tour en espa\u00f1ol para descubrir Menorca con el formato que mejor encaje contigo. <strong style=\"color: #1d294d;\">Las experiencias privadas nunca comparten grupo.<\/strong><\/p><\/div><\/section><section style=\"padding: 28px 0 94px;\"><div style=\"width: min(1180px,calc(100% - clamp(16px,4vw,32px))); margin: auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 590px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 280px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ded9ce; background: #fff; color: #1d294d;\"><div style=\"position: relative; height: 340px; background: url('https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/lugares-imprescindibles-menorca.jpg') center\/cover no-repeat;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(251,250,247,.95); color: #24376f; font-family: Georgia,serif;\">01<\/span><\/div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; padding: 28px 30px;\"><p><span style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Historia y arquitectura<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 8px 0 12px; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Ciutadella, a tu ritmo<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #657083;\">Palacios, callejuelas y las historias que explican por qu\u00e9 fue capital. Una mirada local a la ciudad m\u00e1s monumental de la isla.<\/p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; margin-top: 21px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #ded9ce; color: #596578; font-size: 13px;\">\u25cf 2 horas\u25cf Hasta 20 personas<\/div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\"><div><small style=\"display: block; color: #657083; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Desde \u00b7 por grupo<\/small><strong style=\"font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 400; color: #24376f;\">120 \u20ac<\/strong><\/div><p><a style=\"color: #24376f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\" >Completo hasta 2027<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 410px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 280px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ded9ce; background: #fff; color: #1d294d;\"><div style=\"position: relative; height: 340px; background: url('https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/tour-privado-mahon.jpg') center\/cover no-repeat;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(251,250,247,.95); color: #24376f; font-family: Georgia,serif;\">02<\/span><\/div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; padding: 28px 30px;\"><p><span style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Historia y m\u00fasica<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 8px 0 12px; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">El Mah\u00f3n brit\u00e1nico<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #657083;\">La ciudad que mira al mayor puerto natural del Mediterr\u00e1neo, con acceso al \u00f3rgano de Santa Mar\u00eda.<\/p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; margin-top: 21px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #ded9ce; color: #596578; font-size: 13px;\">\u25cf 2 horas\u25cf Entrada incluida<\/div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\"><div><small style=\"display: block; color: #657083; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Desde \u00b7 por grupo<\/small><strong style=\"font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 400; color: #24376f;\">120 \u20ac<\/strong><\/div><p><a style=\"color: #24376f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\" >Completo hasta 2027<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 410px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 280px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ded9ce; background: #fff; color: #1d294d;\"><div style=\"position: relative; height: 340px; background: url('https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Naveta20des20Tudons20-20001.jpg') center\/cover no-repeat;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(251,250,247,.95); color: #24376f; font-family: Georgia,serif;\">03<\/span><\/div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; padding: 28px 30px;\"><p><span style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Patrimonio mundial<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 8px 0 12px; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Menorca Talay\u00f3tica<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #657083;\">Tres yacimientos para comprender una sociedad que levant\u00f3 monumentos \u00fanicos hace 3.000 a\u00f1os.<\/p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; margin-top: 21px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #ded9ce; color: #596578; font-size: 13px;\">\u25cf 4 horas\u25cf 3 yacimientos\u25cf Ruta privada<\/div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\"><div><small style=\"display: block; color: #657083; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Precio \u00b7 por grupo<\/small><strong style=\"font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 400; color: #24376f;\">240 \u20ac<\/strong><\/div><p><a style=\"color: #24376f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\" >Completo hasta 2027<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 410px; max-width: 578px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 280px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ded9ce; background: #fff; color: #1d294d;\"><div style=\"position: relative; height: 340px; background: url('https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/visita-guiada-ciutadella.webp') center\/cover no-repeat;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(251,250,247,.95); color: #24376f; font-family: Georgia,serif;\">04<\/span><span style=\"position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 18px; padding: 8px 11px; background: #17264f; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase;\">En espa\u00f1ol<\/span><\/div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; padding: 28px 30px;\"><p><span style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Operado por Meloussa Tours<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 8px 0 12px; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Free Tour de Ciutadella<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #657083;\">Un recorrido en grupo por Ses Voltes, la Catedral, el Born y el puerto para descubrir la antigua capital de Menorca.<\/p><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; margin-top: 21px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid #ded9ce; color: #596578; font-size: 13px;\">\u25cf 2 horas aprox.\u25cf Solo en espa\u00f1ol\u25cf Reserva inmediata<\/div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;\"><div><small style=\"display: block; color: #657083; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Precio<\/small><strong style=\"font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; color: #24376f;\">Aportaci\u00f3n libre<\/strong><\/div><p><a style=\"color: #24376f; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\" >Completo hasta 2027<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section style=\"background: #17264f; color: #fff;\"><div style=\"width: min(1180px,calc(100% - clamp(16px,4vw,32px))); margin: auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; min-height: 400px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-height: 400px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 34px; background: linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 30%,rgba(8,18,44,.9)),url('https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/daniel-vaquera-sintes.png') center 18%\/240px auto no-repeat,#e8e7e2;\"><div><p><span style=\"color: #63d0a3; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Tu gu\u00eda en Menorca<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; color: #fff; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400;\">Daniel Vaquera<\/h3><\/div><\/div><div style=\"flex: 2 1 560px; padding: 60px 7%;\"><div style=\"color: #63d0a3; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Una forma distinta de visitar<\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; color: #fff; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: clamp(34px,4vw,48px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Menos guion. M\u00e1s conversaci\u00f3n, contexto y tiempo para mirar.<\/h2><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 26px 38px; margin-top: 38px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; padding-left: 17px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(99,208,163,.7);\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-weight: 400;\">Solo vuestro grupo<\/strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.64); font-size: 13px;\">Nunca se comparte con desconocidos.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; padding-left: 17px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(99,208,163,.7);\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-weight: 400;\">Gu\u00eda oficial local<\/strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.64); font-size: 13px;\">Acreditado y menorqu\u00edn de toda la vida.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; padding-left: 17px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(99,208,163,.7);\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-weight: 400;\">Un ritmo flexible<\/strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.64); font-size: 13px;\">Adaptado a edades y movilidad.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; padding-left: 17px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(99,208,163,.7);\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-weight: 400;\">Precio sin sorpresas<\/strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.64); font-size: 13px;\">Tarifa cerrada y cancelaci\u00f3n flexible.<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section style=\"padding: 88px 0;\"><div style=\"width: min(1180px,calc(100% - clamp(16px,4vw,32px))); margin: auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px 90px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 320px;\"><div style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Antes de reservar<\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 12px 0 20px; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Lo que conviene saber<\/h2><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #657083;\">Si vuestra situaci\u00f3n es especial, escribidme. Es m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil dise\u00f1ar una buena visita cuando conozco al grupo.<\/p><\/div><div style=\"flex: 2 1 560px; border-top: 1px solid #ded9ce;\"><details style=\"padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ded9ce;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif;\">\u00bfC\u00f3mo reservo una excursi\u00f3n?<\/summary><p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; color: #657083;\">Entra en la experiencia y env\u00eda la solicitud. Daniel confirmar\u00e1 personalmente la disponibilidad y los detalles.<\/p><\/details><details style=\"padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ded9ce;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif;\">\u00bfEl precio es por persona o por grupo?<\/summary><p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; color: #657083;\">Las visitas privadas tienen un precio cerrado por grupo.<\/p><\/details><details style=\"padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ded9ce;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif;\">\u00bfSe puede adaptar el recorrido?<\/summary><p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; color: #657083;\">S\u00ed. El ritmo y el contenido se ajustan a los intereses, edades y necesidades de movilidad.<\/p><\/details><details style=\"padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ded9ce;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif;\">\u00bfQu\u00e9 pasa si tengo que cancelar?<\/summary><p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; color: #657083;\">La cancelaci\u00f3n es gratuita hasta 24 horas antes. No se pide pago adelantado en las rutas privadas.<\/p><\/details><\/div><\/div><\/section><section style=\"padding: 74px 0; background: #f2eee5;\"><div style=\"width: min(1180px,calc(100% - clamp(16px,4vw,32px))); margin: auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 90px;\"><div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px;\"><div style=\"color: #bd9142; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Menorca con contexto<\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; color: #1d294d; font-family: 'Trajan Pro',Georgia,serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15;\">Una isla que se entiende mejor acompa\u00f1ado<\/h2><\/div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 450px; 